  "description": "UnlimitedPDF is an enterprise-grade, pure .NET PDF library for creating PDF documents with text, tables, images, headers, and footers, merging and splitting existing PDFs, and converting HTML to PDF, saved to a file or a stream. No third-party dependencies.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
